        "type": "basic",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Price</strong> 2 bx; <strong>Weight</strong> 5 lb.;</p><p>This net of thick rope can ensnare animals or enemies. While holding this net, you can use <span class=\"cosmere-icon\">1</span> to make an [[test skill=ath]] against the Physical defense of a Large or smaller character within 15 feet of you. On a success, the character is @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg-mistborn-handbook.handbook.JournalEntry.b684FTgeTTE90HLs.JournalEntryPage.vyYzxzfhwORSeTLw#restrained]{Restrained} and knocked Prone. That character or another who can reach them can use the Interact action to make a [[test dc=15 skill=ath]], freeing the trapped character on a success. If a character is @UUID[Compendium.cosmere-rpg-mistborn-handbook.handbook.JournalEntry.b684FTgeTTE90HLs.JournalEntryPage.vyYzxzfhwORSeTLw#restrained]{Restrained} by multiple nets, they must be freed from each separately.</p>",
